NOTE ON SOURCE MATERIAL / 素材版權說明

This licence covers the source code and documentation in this repository only.

It does NOT cover the video material the pipeline processes. Those videos are
the copyrighted work of their respective creators. This repository contains no
videos, no audio, and no full transcripts — `work/` and `out/` are gitignored.
The golden-set files under `tests/golden/` contain only human-made labels plus
the public title and URL of each video. Short phrases quoted in `docs/` are
there to document specific ASR errors.

本授權僅涵蓋本倉庫的程式碼與文件，**不涵蓋管線處理的影片素材**——
那些是各自著作權人的作品。本倉庫不含任何影片、音訊或完整逐字稿；
`work/` 與 `out/` 都在 `.gitignore` 裡。`tests/golden/` 只有人工標註
與公開的影片標題、URL。`docs/` 裡的短句引用是為了記錄具體的 ASR 錯誤。
